<!doctype lake><title>微服务架构设计</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1>微服务架构设计</h1>

<h2>架构概览</h2>
<p>本文档描述系统的微服务架构设计，采用领域驱动设计（DDD）方法拆分服务边界。</p>

<h2>架构图</h2>
<card type="block" name="diagram" value="data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cngraph%20TD%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%5BAPI%20Gateway%5D%20--%3E%20B%5B%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%20--%3E%20C%5B%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20A%20--%3E%20D%5B%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20B%20--%3E%20E%5B%28%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%BA%93%29%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20C%20--%3E%20F%5B%28%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95%E5%BA%93%29%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20D%20--%3E%20G%5B%28%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E5%BA%93%29%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ISWEN%22%7D"></card>

<h2>服务对比</h2>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="150"><col width="150"><col width="150"><col width="150"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>服务名</td><td>技术栈</td><td>数据库</td><td>部署方式</td></tr>
<tr><td>用户服务</td><td>Go + Gin</td><td>PostgreSQL</td><td>K8s</td></tr>
<tr><td>订单服务</td><td>Java + Spring</td><td>MySQL</td><td>K8s</td></tr>
<tr><td>支付服务</td><td>Python + FastAPI</td><td>PostgreSQL</td><td>Docker</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>核心算法示例</h2>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cndef%20calculate_refund%28balance%2C%20rebate%2C%20discount%3D0.75%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E9%80%80%E6%AC%BE%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20base%20%3D%20%28balance%20-%20rebate%29%20%2A%20discount%5Cn%20%20%20%20fee%20%3D%20min%28balance%20%2A%200.2%2C%20100%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20base%20-%20fee%5Cn%5Cnresult%20%3D%20calculate_refund%281000%2C%200%29%5Cnprint%28f%5C%22%E9%80%80%E6%AC%BE%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%3A%20%7Bresult%7D%5C%22%29%5Cn%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%227gJTw%22%7D"></card>

<h2>性能公式</h2>
<p>系统吞吐量计算：</p>
<p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20Q%7D%7BD%20%5C%5Ctimes%201000%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UljLO%22%7D"></card></p>
<p>其中 T 为吞吐量（req/s），N 为节点数，Q 为单节点 QPS，D 为延迟（ms）。</p>

<card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EdiiE%22%7D"></card>

<h2>部署拓扑</h2>
<p>采用 Kubernetes 集群部署，每个微服务独立命名空间。</p>
